# Baseball Bat: "When this Equipment enters, attach it to target creature you control" (CR 701.3, 603.6a): only a creature
# its controller has qualifies - the lone legal target, Savannah Lions, is chosen although Bot2 has an Ornithopter - and the
# Bat gives +1/+1 to what it is attached to (Savannah Lions 2/1 becomes 3/2, CR 301.5). "Whenever equipped creature attacks,
# tap up to one target creature": any creature may be chosen, so Bot2's Ornithopter, which can no longer block, is tapped
# and the 3/2 Lions' attack is unblocked.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Savannah Lions
Baseball Bat
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Savannah Lions.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Baseball Bat.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Baseball Bat.AttachedTo = Savannah Lions
? Bot1.Battlefield.Savannah Lions.Power = 3
? Bot1.Battlefield.Savannah Lions.Toughness = 2
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Savannah Lions > Bot2)
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter; Savannah Lions)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Bot2.Life = 17
